.TH mbtrnpp 1 "7 September 2026" "MB-System 5.0" "MB-System 5.0"
.SH NAME
\fBmbtrnpp\fP \- Real-time preprocessor that reads multibeam sonar data, applies
automated cleaning and downsampling, and passes the resulting bathymetry to a
terrain relative navigation (TRN) process.

.SH VERSION
Version 5.0

.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBmbtrnpp\fP
