.SH BUGS
Unsupervised real-time terrain navigation is inherently harder to debug than
the interactive \fBMB-System\fP tools it borrows cleaning logic from; when
something looks wrong, start by rereading the log files and rechecking the
configuration with \fB--help\fP before suspecting the code.
